{
  "archive": "provenance_full.qvf",
  "description": "A settled (converged) archive whose provenance uses every typed field: software (one item with a url, one with a vendor key), a 40-character git_commit, n_threads, n_mpi_ranks, n_gpus, and the two UTC time stamps (one with a fractional second) that agree with wall_seconds and with the run.record. The job.spec that asked for the run is preserved; its n_cores is a hint and differs from what the run used (spec \u00a7 3.2, \u00a7 5.9).",
  "source_program": "qvf-conformance",
  "kinds": [
    "job.spec",
    "run.record",
    "structure"
  ],
  "checks": [
